  LINKED LIST
│
├── Node = data + pointer
│
├── Head = first node
│
├── Last node → nullptr
│
├── Access → O(n)
│
├── Search → O(n)
│
├── Insert beginning → O(1)
│
├── Delete beginning → O(1)
│
├── Reverse → prev + curr + next
│
├── Middle → slow + fast
│
├── Cycle → slow + fast
│
├── Nth from end → two pointers
│
└── Merge sorted lists → two pointers
  

  
